WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
- [Woman] Do you see any trends
for me to use with my students

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:05.100
to connect with parents?

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:07.709
- [Gary] My most practical 
advice to a sixth grade teacher

00:00:07.709 --> 00:00:10.523
is to try to build 
the self-esteem

00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:11.873
of the students in your class.

00:00:13.215 --> 00:00:15.293
That would be, that is the thing

00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:17.018
I spend my entire 
life thinking about

00:00:17.018 --> 00:00:20.901
which is the only tool 
against all the pressures

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:23.223
that our kids 
face is self-esteem.

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.605
That is the weapon.

00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:29.130
And so I only had one 
teacher ever that I saw

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.233
now rewinding my brain and
realizing what she was doing

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:34.649
that went person 
by person in her class

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:38.142
and accelerated and celebrated

00:00:38.142 --> 00:00:40.232
their unique 
individual strengths.

00:00:40.232 --> 00:00:41.888
Whether it was sports, school,

00:00:41.888 --> 00:00:45.658
personality, humor, 
kindness, prettiness,

00:00:45.658 --> 00:00:49.377
whatever it was 
she built self-esteem

00:00:49.377 --> 00:00:50.610
and that's why I remember her.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.056
(light music)

